      "<color=#D9CCF2>Need help getting started? Go to</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/help</b></color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Join the</color> <color=#FF8FD8>Nightshade Discord</color><color=#D9CCF2>! Head to</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/info</b></color> <color=#D9CCF2>and use the QR code to join us :)</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Support the server and keep the chaos alive with</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/donate</b></color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Questions about wipes, rules, or commands? Check</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/info</b></color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Need a hand? Ask in chat or hop into Discord in the</color> <color=#FF8FD8>GeekSquad</color> <color=#D9CCF2>channel</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>This is a</color> <color=#FF8FD8>Hybrid PvE/PvP</color> <color=#D9CCF2>server. If the map starts yelling at you, pay attention.</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Most deployables, vehicles, and storage are protected.</color> <color=#FF8FD8>Unauthorized raiding is not allowed.</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Player-built</color> <color=#FF8FD8>Raid Bases</color> <color=#D9CCF2>can be defended for bonus loot and rewards. See</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/raidbuilder</b></color> <color=#D9CCF2>for info.</color>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>Helicopters are still emotionally committed to ruining your day.</color></i>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Use</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/remove</b></color> <color=#D9CCF2>carefully. Future you will appreciate it.</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Some monuments rotate into</color> <color=#FF8FD8>PvP zones</color><color=#D9CCF2>. The dome is not decorative.</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Supply signals with</color> <color=#FF8FD8>special skins</color> <color=#D9CCF2>may trigger custom events instead of normal drops.</color>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Nightshade uses persistent clans, vehicle protection, and shared ownership systems. Choose your teammates wisely.</color>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>If something looks cursed, broken, or haunted... tell an admin. Unless it's intentional.</color></i>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>You can preview server systems, commands, and progression info using</color> <color=#C77DFF><b>/info</b></color>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>Event bosses scale in difficulty. Confidence is not a valid armor stat.</color></i>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>Some events are serverwide. Some are personal. Some are both. Good luck figuring it out.</color></i>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>Please don't feed the loot goblins.</color></i>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>The server logs everything. Even your questionable life choices.</color></i>",
      "<i><color=#BFB3D6>Yes, the helicopters are supposed to sound angry.</color></i>",
      "<color=#D9CCF2>Reminder: if the giant</color> <color=#FF8FD8>purple dome</color> <color=#D9CCF2>appears, something unfortunate is happening nearby.</color>",
